WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.660
- We have hit the moment in the show

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.970
when I share something
awesome from social media

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.480
you may have missed, you're welcome.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.696
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:06.696 --> 00:00:09.980
(music and crowd cheering)

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.180
At only eight years old,

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.730
LeLe is a musical force
to be reckoned with.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:16.350
She's played piano at some of
the most renowned venues out

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.420
there, including Carnegie
Hall, not too shabby.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.780
But her favorite performances

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.430
aren't on grand stages actually,

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.180
they're at her local senior center

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.200
or playing virtually for frontline workers

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.570
and hospital patients
right here in New York.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.518
Check her out in action.

00:00:30.518 --> 00:00:33.185
(piano playing)

00:00:37.909 --> 00:00:40.201
(crowd cheering)

00:00:40.201 --> 00:00:41.309
Oh my gosh.

00:00:41.309 --> 00:00:42.197
(Kelly imitates piano)

00:00:42.197 --> 00:00:43.281
I'm like what?

00:00:43.281 --> 00:00:45.263
We have LeLe on the line, right now.

00:00:45.263 --> 00:00:46.233
Hi LeLe.

00:00:46.233 --> 00:00:47.850
(crowd cheering)

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.267
- I'm so excited.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:53.580
- Oh my gosh, first of
all, you look beautiful.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.420
You need to know that, you look stunning.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.270
How long have you been playing?

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.103
- I've been playing when I was

00:00:59.103 --> 00:01:01.490
only three and a half years old.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:03.250
I have perfect pitch.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.420
I can remember the melody
and copy it by my hand.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.263
I love playing the piano.

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:10.963
- Oh my Gosh.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.650
I love you.

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:17.330
Oh, so, what do you love

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:19.990
about playing for seniors and patients?

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:22.210
- Because I can make people happy.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:25.630
I still remember that one day
after I finished my playing

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:28.727
a senior came up to me and
hugged me tightly and said,

00:01:28.727 --> 00:01:33.106
"Honey, you made my day.
You are my sunshine."

00:01:33.106 --> 00:01:37.543
I saw tears in her eyes and I
knew that it was happy tears.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.943
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:44.830
LeLe, at some point,

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.840
you've got to come in the
studio and you've got to play.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:47.890
I want to sing with you.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:48.860
I just want to hang out with you.

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:50.170
You make me so happy.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.963
God, what a gift you are.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:54.480
Thank you so much, LeLe.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.770
I'm liking your posts right now

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:00.370
and that's not all, our season
long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:01.960
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:04.550
likes to celebrate those
who create fearlessly,

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:06.040
just like you.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:08.500
So they'll be using their
Frixion Erasable pen to write

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.762
you a check for a thousand dollars, LeLe.

00:02:10.762 --> 00:02:13.730
(crowd cheering)

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.143
Thank you so much, LeLe.

